  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "世界建築文化旅行規畫",
    "sub_ename": "TRAVEL PLANNING OF WORLD ARCHITECTURAL CULTURE",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要結合旅行與建築兩大領域，幫助學生能應用所學安排世界建築旅行，以城市建築文化為基礎，增進全球歷史地理宏觀視野，並深化國際交流體驗能力。課程內容包含：世界建築旅行之旅途與排程經驗分享；建築藝術文化之歷史與地理基礎知識教學；旅行排程相關知識分享與預算控制。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed to combine the two areas of travel and architecture to help students apply what they have learned in arranging world architectural trips. It enhances the global historical and geographical perspective of students based on urban architecture and culture, and deepens their ability to experience international communication. The course content includes: sharing the experience of journey and scheduling on world architectural trips, teaching the basics of history and geography of architectural art and culture, and sharing the knowledge of travel scheduling and budget control.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
